    english: Do you want to extract and use this file?
  - key: MODAL_UseFile
    japanese: "\u3053\u306E\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30EB\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F"
    english: Do you want to use this file?
